@startuml
!theme plain
title Diagramme de Séquence - Flux Client ZAI E-commerce

actor Client as C
participant "Interface Web" as UI
participant "AuthController" as AC
participant "ProductController" as PC
participant "CartController" as CC
participant "OrderController" as OC
participant "AccountController" as ACC
participant "DolibarrAPI" as DAPI
database "Base Dolibarr" as DB

== Authentification ==
C -> UI: Connexion/Inscription
activate UI
UI -> AC: authenticate(credentials)
activate AC
AC -> DAPI: validateUser(email, password)
activate DAPI
DAPI -> DB: SELECT * FROM llx_user WHERE email = ?
activate DB
DB --> DAPI: userData
deactivate DB
DAPI --> AC: userValidated
deactivate DAPI
AC --> UI: sessionCreated
deactivate AC
UI --> C: Dashboard client
deactivate UI

== Navigation Produits ==
C -> UI: Parcourir catalogue
activate UI
UI -> PC: getProducts(filters)
activate PC
PC -> DB: SELECT * FROM llx_product WHERE active = 1
activate DB
DB --> PC: productList[]
deactivate DB
PC --> UI: productsData
deactivate PC
UI --> C: Liste des produits
deactivate UI

== Gestion Panier ==
C -> UI: Ajouter au panier
activate UI
UI -> CC: addToCart(productId, quantity)
activate CC
CC -> DB: SELECT stock FROM llx_stock WHERE fk_product = ?
activate DB
DB --> CC: stockLevel
deactivate DB

alt Stock disponible
    CC -> CC: addItemToSession(productId, quantity)
    CC --> UI: itemAdded
    UI --> C: Produit ajouté
else Stock insuffisant
    CC --> UI: error("Stock insuffisant")
    UI --> C: Message d'erreur
end
deactivate CC
deactivate UI

== Finalisation Commande ==
C -> UI: Valider panier
activate UI
UI -> OC: processCheckout()
activate OC
OC -> OC: validateCartItems()
OC -> OC: calculateTotals()
OC --> UI: checkoutData
deactivate OC
UI --> C: Page de checkout
deactivate UI

C -> UI: Confirmer commande
activate UI
UI -> OC: createOrder(orderData)
activate OC
OC -> DAPI: createDolibarrOrder(orderData)
activate DAPI
DAPI -> DB: INSERT INTO llx_commande
activate DB
DB --> DAPI: orderId
deactivate DB
DAPI --> OC: orderCreated
deactivate DAPI
OC --> UI: orderConfirmed
deactivate OC
UI --> C: Confirmation commande
deactivate UI

== Suivi Commande ==
C -> UI: Consulter mes commandes
activate UI
UI -> ACC: getOrderHistory(userId)
activate ACC
ACC -> DB: SELECT * FROM llx_commande WHERE fk_soc = ?
activate DB
DB --> ACC: orderHistory[]
deactivate DB
ACC --> UI: ordersData
deactivate ACC
UI --> C: Historique des commandes
deactivate UI

C -> UI: Détails commande
activate UI
UI -> OC: getOrderDetails(orderId)
activate OC
OC -> DB: SELECT * FROM llx_commande c JOIN llx_commandedet cd ON c.rowid = cd.fk_commande WHERE c.rowid = ?
activate DB
DB --> OC: orderDetails
deactivate DB
OC --> UI: detailedOrder
deactivate OC
UI --> C: Détails de la commande
deactivate UI

@enduml